  "prefLabel": "Env-A 3010.03 Imprisonment and Fines",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 3010.03 Imprisonment and Fines. In addition to any sentence of imprisonment, probation, or conditional discharge, any person found guilty of any violation pursuant to Env-A 3010.02, notwithstanding RSA 651:2, shall be fined not more than $25,000 for each violation and each day of continuing violation.\n\nSource. #6441, EXEMPT, eff 1-21-97",
